                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9fe50aa8-05f3-3137-a54b-f9e8c82ef889",
                        "entry_id": "25267997-1384-34fe-a108-6728f6e7eebc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "związany z traumą – uszkodzeniem organizmu"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03d9f7ee-40b0-407b-8f9c-b9e6379a7124",
                                "sense_id": "9fe50aa8-05f3-3137-a54b-f9e8c82ef889",
                                "text": "Długotrwałe skutki traumatycznego urazu mózgu są często zależne od tego, jaki obszar mózgu został uszkodzony w wypadku drogowym"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77c1a015-0b65-38ff-ab13-648d3f666e85",
                        "entry_id": "25267997-1384-34fe-a108-6728f6e7eebc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "związany z traumą, ciężkim przeżyciem"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "psychology"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38552b99-ec0e-48d7-99d5-7808db241cee",
                                "sense_id": "77c1a015-0b65-38ff-ab13-648d3f666e85",
                                "text": "Nie jem mięsa od roku. Decyzji nie podjąłem pod wpływem traumatycznych przeżyć, jakie dostarczyły mi zdjęcia z rzeźni"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "331b5473-4b69-45a6-ad46-b88f8849e21b",
                        "source_entry_id": "25267997-1384-34fe-a108-6728f6e7eebc",
                        "source_sense_id": "9fe50aa8-05f3-3137-a54b-f9e8c82ef889",
                        "target_lang_word": "traumatic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "traumatic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd0e39e4-2ec2-3c81-95c6-944f92a7aa7d",
                                        "entry_id": "a96def46-fff1-3f00-b556-fbaa937f6fd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, caused by, or causing trauma."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73d33a93-7558-494c-93d1-15c2e2ebac49",
                                                "sense_id": "cd0e39e4-2ec2-3c81-95c6-944f92a7aa7d",
                                                "text": "It's a sort of disease. There's a scientific name for it. Trau- something. Traumatic symplegia, that's it. This cat has traumatic symplegia. In other words, putting it in simple language adapted to the lay mind, where other cats are content to get their eight hours, Augustus wants his twenty-four."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b01096e-6857-400f-8d0d-2f2e562fac72",
                                                "sense_id": "cd0e39e4-2ec2-3c81-95c6-944f92a7aa7d",
                                                "text": "\"I've seen more patients, but never this many patients with this number of severe injuries,\" said Dr. Michael Morkin, chief of Renown's emergency department[…]. \"It was traumatic.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70b6cbaa-1588-38dd-bb19-479fe66f58ec",
                                        "entry_id": "a96def46-fff1-3f00-b556-fbaa937f6fd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to wounds; applied to wounds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fad672fe-95f1-3e2d-aa49-e4c1c038cdb5",
                                        "entry_id": "a96def46-fff1-3f00-b556-fbaa937f6fd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adapted to the cure of wounds; vulnerary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14220007-546d-49d1-a58d-7c2dac866163",
                                                "sense_id": "fad672fe-95f1-3e2d-aa49-e4c1c038cdb5",
                                                "text": "traumatick Decoctions"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af57d0d3-1850-3220-86a3-06036a75fb3e",
                                        "entry_id": "a96def46-fff1-3f00-b556-fbaa937f6fd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Produced by wounds, especially as opposed to disease or other process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7323d4f-0f0c-4cd9-91f7-57fcace3b8d5",
                                                "sense_id": "af57d0d3-1850-3220-86a3-06036a75fb3e",
                                                "text": "traumatic tetanus; traumatic brain injury"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98e2c6e8-dbc3-47c8-8821-2aa082776fe0",
                                                "sense_id": "af57d0d3-1850-3220-86a3-06036a75fb3e",
                                                "text": "Repeated trauma or shaking to the brain can be even worse, leading to chronic traumatic encephalopathy, or CTE."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "traumatic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5eaf28b-8c57-3803-97d3-66eee7b972ef",
                                        "entry_id": "1284fa11-3fcb-3185-96d4-eb52d24cf01b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A medicine for wounds; a vulnerary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee666032-81ee-4b3c-92d4-1c9b3ec2c7eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "25267997-1384-34fe-a108-6728f6e7eebc",
                        "source_sense_id": "9fe50aa8-05f3-3137-a54b-f9e8c82ef889",
                        "target_lang_word": "traumatique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "traumatique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25fa894d-abff-3f6b-8c84-fe46c2b74f27",
                                        "entry_id": "e969d5cd-e57c-3156-84e0-bcaca6c91dee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif aux plaies, aux blessures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e067ece-9f2b-4dd5-83de-394631c9941d",
                                                "sense_id": "25fa894d-abff-3f6b-8c84-fe46c2b74f27",
                                                "text": "Choc traumatique. — Fièvre traumatique. — Hémorragie traumatique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "371b078e-af28-3151-8557-a2377f7d32b7",
                                        "entry_id": "e969d5cd-e57c-3156-84e0-bcaca6c91dee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif au trauma psychologique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be40baa4-dfb2-44f4-9a6c-1385f2ff4516",
                                                "sense_id": "371b078e-af28-3151-8557-a2377f7d32b7",
                                                "text": "Sans remonter à l’événement traumatique fondateur que furent les massacres de la Saint-Barthélemy, on rappellera que la minorité réformée fut l’objet, sous Louis XIV, d’un « mémoricide » sans précédent : […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "914a4828-a701-46a9-957a-09a4562ec47e",
                                                "sense_id": "371b078e-af28-3151-8557-a2377f7d32b7",
                                                "text": "Le thérapeute doit traduire en mots, de façon la plus juste possible, la réalité du vécu traumatique et de ses effets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4187f0fc-f172-44fa-845d-0255f100594a",
                                                "sense_id": "371b078e-af28-3151-8557-a2377f7d32b7",
                                                "text": "L’événement traumatique agit à la manière d’un « corps étranger » en soi, qui, même longtemps après l’événement, continue à agir, comme un événement présent. Il reste actuel, sans être intégré ni rattaché aux représentations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60653a74-026d-4ef5-b52e-3176b1e1d4e1",
                                                "sense_id": "371b078e-af28-3151-8557-a2377f7d32b7",
                                                "text": "Comment la victime peut-elle accéder aux représentations de l’expérience traumatique si elle n’est plus intimement assurée qu’un autre peut les entendre, les recevoir et y donner de l’importance ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d0bd9344-fb1d-4300-bf1f-3683f17b7f7e",
